## Project summary

**{{.Name}}** — {{.Description}}

This is a **multi-agent system** built with [LangGraph](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph)
(agent orchestration) and [LangChain](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain) (LLM toolkit),
served via [LangServe](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langserve) on FastAPI.
Observability is wired to [LangSmith](https://smith.langchain.com).

